---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tous les articles
description: Tous les décryptages Grand Marketing et toutes les adaptations Petit Budget, par thème.
activeNav: categories
permalink: /blog/
---
{%- import "partials/macros.njk" as m -%}
<section class="page-hero" style="background:var(--yellow)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Accueil</a> / Blog</div>
    <h1 class="display h-1">Tous les articles</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:20px">Six thèmes, chacun décliné en deux versions : le décryptage Grand Marketing et l'adaptation Petit Budget.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:88px" aria-label="Articles">
  <div class="section-head" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start">
    {{ m.catFilters("all-grid", "all-count", "all-empty", categories.categories) }}
    {{ m.trackFilters("all-grid", "all-count2", "all-empty") }}
    <span class="result-count" id="all-count" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <span class="sr-only" id="all-count2" aria-live="polite"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="grid" id="all-grid">
    {%- for a in collections.articles %}
    {{ m.card(a, categories.categories, true) }}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="empty" id="all-empty" {% if collections.articles.length %}hidden{% endif %}>Aucun article pour ce filtre pour l'instant.</p>
</section>
<section class="section section-dark" aria-labelledby="themes-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="display h-2" id="themes-title" style="margin-bottom:32px">Les thèmes</h2>
    <div class="cat-tiles">
      {%- for c in categories.categories %}
      <a class="cat-tile" href="/categorie/{{ c.slug }}/"><span>{{ c.name }}</span><span class="arrow" style="background:{{ c.color }}" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
